WEBVTT

00:14:26.537 --> 00:14:30.537
will have an undeniable place

00:14:30.579 --> 00:14:34.329
and permanent place in this great country

00:14:34.371 --> 00:14:36.329
and in America's lexicon.

00:14:36.912 --> 00:14:43.871
I also ask you to join me
so no child will ever feel

00:14:43.912 --> 00:14:48.121
that way that I felt in that classroom

00:14:48.162 --> 00:14:51.329
when I did not know the history

00:14:51.371 --> 00:14:53.787
that was my legacy.

00:14:54.496 --> 00:14:58.287
We can all work together
and make this happen.

00:14:58.829 --> 00:15:02.787
Thank you for listening
to this little Black girl's story.